# macOS system files
.DS_Store

# VSCode settings
.vscode/

# Python cache files
__pycache__/

# Package installed history files
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Ignore model checkpoints
*.pth

# Claude Code local settings (personal preferences)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Temporary Claude Code files (known bug)
tmpclaude-*-cwd

# Optional: plan files created during builds
plan.md
```

### **What TO COMMIT to GitHub:**

✅ `.claude/settings.json` - Team-shared configuration  
✅ `.claude/commands/` - Custom slash commands for the team  
✅ `CLAUDE.md` - Project documentation/context  
✅ `.worktreeinclude` - Worktree configuration (if used)

### **What NOT TO COMMIT:**

❌ `.claude/settings.local.json` - Personal settings  
❌ `tmpclaude-*-cwd` - Temporary files  
❌ Any session-specific or machine-specific data

---

## **Git Attribution When Publishing**

When Claude Code creates commits, it automatically adds attribution to commit messages by default:
```
fix: resolve authentication bug in login flow

Fixes the issue where users were being logged out unexpectedly 
after session timeout.

Generated with Claude Code
Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>